  "summary": "Comfortable in different positions from project management to freelance contractor. Formally trained at four year university program and continuously self-training in diverse computer skills. Emphasis on continuous code refactoring, documenting, and organizing to maximize productivity. Experienced at debugging personal code and existing systems. Preference for free, open source, platform agnostic technologies. \n\nPrimary focus on web application development, internal business systems, and consumer facing web products. Strong desire to build  analytical tools for large data tables to produce actionable business intelligence. Comfortable in both functional and object oriented programming. \n\nKnowledgeable in installing, configuring, and troubleshooting 3rd party software, physical hardware, and cloud based assets. Capable of researching technology requirements, system integration, and training team members with nontechnical backgrounds. Solid understanding of most computing and networking architectures.\n",
